WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.536
HOWARD STERN: Bruce Springsteen
is a few inches away from me

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.471
-and I am, I'm star-struck.
-(LAUGHS)

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.207
♪ (BRUCE SPRINGSTEEN PLAYS
"THUNDER ROAD" ON PIANO) ♪

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.776
-STERN:<i> Do you have a song
 in your head everyday?</i>
-BRUCE SPRINGSTEEN:<i> No.</i>

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.043
<i>Years will go by with nothing.</i>

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.612
-STERN:<i> Really?</i>
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.684
First thing you want is a good
metaphor, or a good title.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.486
<i>You got to imagine-- You know,
 it's like anything else.</i>

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.354
<i> You have to take
 your mind there,</i>

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.456
and hope that
your ass will follow.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.491
(STERN LAUGHS)

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:32.599
<i>♪ Oh! Thunder Road, sit tight
 Take hold Thunder Road ♪</i>

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.235
Finally gotten me
to cry on the air.

00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:38.671
-It's the first time ever. Wow.
-(LAUGHS)

